  "_comment": [
    "The running order, with an explicit hold per shot.",
    "",
    "Holds are sized from the narration that sits in them plus roughly three",
    "seconds of air, so nothing is clipped and nothing sits in silence waiting.",
    "The rewritten script is nearly twice as long as the first one, so the video",
    "is longer than three minutes \u2014 that is the right trade. A judge who",
    "understands what MagicBlock is doing here is worth more than fifteen",
    "seconds saved.",
    "",
    "No split-screen. Two mirrored top-down arenas never read as one match, and",
    "the claim they existed to support is not something this footage can carry",
    "honestly. The match plays on a single client.",
    "",
    "Shot kinds:",
    "  src    \u2014 a single-client capture, centred",
    "  match  \u2014 seat A's recording of the staked match, same treatment",
    "  frames \u2014 an animated title sequence rendered as PNGs",
    "  web    \u2014 a desktop capture (Solana Explorer), letterboxed",
    "",
    "Three of the four silent beats are gameplay; the fourth is the settlement",
    "screen, which is worth reading without a voice over it."
